  "answer": "No, there is no way to avoid the EUR 90 fee for Flex refunds. According to our policy, Flex refunds are subject to a EUR 90 fee per passenger, which is deducted from the refund amount. However, if you request a Flex refund up to 2 hours before departure, you are eligible for a full refund. If you request it after that, or in case of no-show, the refund is reduced by EUR 50. For more details, please refer to our refund policy or contact our customer service team.",
